From 3d18bdc7bcb673091a3d03f068dcce3b5fd2589c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:24:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Remove isolated data spikes in dashboard API

Adds api/_lib/despike.js and applies it in api/dashboard-data.js: one row
per snapshot_time, and lone spikes (far from both neighbours that agree
with each other) are replaced by the median. Real step changes are kept.
Controlled by H2_DESPIKE / H2_SPIKE_RATIO / H2_SPIKE_AGREE_RATIO /
H2_SPIKE_ABS_FLOOR env vars.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DwYkxVTtsQ2p3Edf8EzRNV
